<title>JAPAN: BOJ injects 100 bln yen into money market - traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ injects 100 bln yen into money market - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) injected a net 100 billion yen into the money market on Wednesday, money traders said.</p>
</text>
